    "description": "Balance AS xxx.X2.yyy series operates on the basis of electromagnetic compensation of the weighed load. Symbol xxx stands for Max in g and symbol yyy stands for the special purpose of the balance (e.g. jewelry balance - CT). Features: full graphic display, plastic cover, stainless steel pan, weighing chamber, automatic internal adjustment system. Equipped with a Data Storage Device (Alibi Memory) per WELMEC 2.5 storing up to 500000 weighing results in internal flash memory with checksum protection. Devices: zero indicator, stability indicator, automatic span adjustment with internal calibration mass, display check, initial zero-setting, zero-tracking, data storage device (alibi memory), service menu via switch on main board, printer, additional display, USB, Ethernet, weighing in carat units. Level indicator with sensitivity of at least 2 mm for a tilt of 2/1000. Interfaces (compliant with 5.3.6 of OIML R76): RS 232, USB 2.0, Ethernet 10/100 Mbit, optionally WiFi. Embedded software with fixed identification, valid software version 2.2.0. The metrological characteristics table is an example of some models within the approved range."
